{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe8; /* warm parchment */
      --card:#fffefb;
      --accent:#8b5e3c; /* warm brown */
      --muted:#7a6b60;
      --accent-2:#d9a66a;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background-color:var(--bg);
      color:var(--muted);
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 240px;
      line-height:1.45;
    }
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(139,94,60,0.06),transparent);backdrop-filter: blur(2px);padding:22px 28px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:0.3px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:0 22px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--card));border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(30,20,10,0.06)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;color:var(--accent);font-size:26px}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .buttons{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(139,94,60,0.12);color:var(--accent)}

    section{margin-top:28px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,15,10,0.04)}

    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:14px}

    /* reveal */
    [data-reveal]{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    [data-reveal].revealed{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}

    /* Session Planner styles */
    .planner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:16px}
    .planner form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,90,0.12);background:#fff}
    .result{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(245,240,236,0.9),#fff);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(130,110,95,0.12);min-height:120px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', monospace;color:#3b2b20}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* FAQ */
    .faq dt{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-top:8px}
    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 12px 0}

    footer{margin:40px 0 80px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}

    /* accessible: reduce motion */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      [data-reveal]{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .planner{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .hero{padding:18px}
      header{padding:12px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style="margin-left:18px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Alchemy</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="cta">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero card" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h1>Reach out — plan a focused aromatherapy VIP day or a shorter consult</h1>
        <p>Book a concentrated day of scent design or request a brief consult. We create approachable, safety-forward suggestions that may support everyday calm and clarity.</p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#planner">Try the Session Planner</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Voices from sessions</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-2);background:transparent">"Clear, practical guidance and blends I actually use."<footer class="small">— L, local client</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-2);background:transparent">"A VIP day that left me with routines I can repeat at home."<footer class="small">— S, remote</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-2);background:transparent">"Thoughtful, safety-first approach and great follow-up notes."<footer class="small">— M, practitioner</footer></blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">What a session may support</h2>
      <p class="small">Each engagement centers on sensible, evidence-aware practice. We avoid promises; instead we offer scents and rituals that may support you in:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Finding a daily scent anchor for rhythm and focus</li>
        <li>Creating a short sequence for transition moments (morning, pause, evening)</li>
        <li>Designing a discreet personal blend and safest-use instructions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">How our VIP Day and consults work</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Pre-session:</strong> A brief intake to note sensitivities, pets, pregnancy, and desired outcomes.</li>
        <li><strong>Session:</strong> A focused in-person or remote hour(s) to select materials and co-create a plan.</li>
        <li><strong>Deliverable:</strong> A clear plan, dilution ratios, patch test notes, and a one-page follow-up.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="small">A VIP Day is a concentrated design and education session; our consults are briefer touchpoints. Pricing and commitments vary — see Investment for details.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="planner" class="card" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Session Planner — build a personal scent plan</h2>
      <div class="planner">
        <form id="plannerForm" onsubmit="return false;" aria-labelledby="planner">
          <div>
            <label for="goal">Primary intention or goal</label>
            <input id="goal" name="goal" type="text" placeholder="e.g., smoother transitions, evening calm" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="setting">Preferred setting</label>
            <select id="setting" name="setting">
              <option>Remote consult (video)</option>
              <option>In-person VIP Day</option>
              <option>Short follow-up (30 min)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="notes">Scent notes you like / avoid</label>
            <input id="notes" name="notes" type="text" placeholder="lavender, citrus, woody, avoid eucalyptus" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="intensity">Intensity preference</label>
            <select id="intensity" name="intensity">
              <option>Mild (subtle)</option>
              <option>Moderate</option>
              <option>Rich (pronounced)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="duration">Desired session length</label>
            <select id="duration" name="duration">
              <option>30 minutes</option>
              <option>60 minutes</option>
              <option>Full VIP Day</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="notesArea">Extra notes</label>
            <textarea id="notesArea" name="notesArea" rows="3" placeholder="Allergies, pets at home, pregnancy, any medications, or scheduling preferences."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="actions">
            <button class="btn" id="buildPlan">Generate plan</button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="clearPlan" type="button">Clear</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Your plan preview</div>
            <div class="small">Plaintext export & copy</div>
          </div>
          <div id="planResult" class="result" aria-live="polite">Build a plan using the form to the left.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="copyBtn">Copy summary</button>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="downloadBtn">Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:10px">Note: The output is a suggested plan. Dilution, patch testing, and environment considerations are included in the summary. No medical claims are made.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card faq" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Frequently asked — safety and logistics</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Do you make medical claims?</dt>
        <dd>We do not make medical claims. Suggestions and practices we provide may support wellbeing in non-medical ways.
        </dd>

        <dt>How do I dilute essential oils?</dt>
        <dd>We include clear dilution guidance in every plan (e.g., 1–3% for topical blends for adults). We recommend testing small amounts and following patch-test instructions we provide.
        </dd>

        <dt>What about pets?</dt>
        <dd>Some oils can affect animals. We always ask about pets and include pet-safe usage notes and ventilation recommendations if needed.
        </dd>

        <dt>Pregnancy and sensitive conditions</dt>
        <dd>If you are pregnant, nursing, or have a serious medical condition, please note that in your intake. We will avoid contraindicated materials and include cautious alternatives; always confirm with your care provider.
        </dd>

        <dt>Do I need a patch test?</dt>
        <dd>Yes — we include a clear patch-test protocol in plans: small dilution on the inner forearm, wait 24 hours, discontinue if irritation occurs.
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="card" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Ready to connect?</h2>
      <p class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      <form id="contactForm" class="small" onsubmit="submitContact(event)">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <input type="text" id="cname" placeholder="Your name" style="flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,90,0.12)" required>
          <input type="email" id="cemail" placeholder="Email" style="flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,90,0.12)" required>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px">
          <textarea id="cmessage" rows="4" placeholder="How can we help? Mention availability and city/state if local: e.g., {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}." style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,90,0.12)"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px">
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Request a time</button>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">See availability</a>
        </div>
        <div id="contactMsg" class="small" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
      </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="small">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Local support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Designed for thoughtful, safety-forward scent work.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Reveal on scroll with respect for prefers-reduced-motion
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const els = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){
        els.forEach(e=>e.classList.add('revealed'));
        return;
      }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('revealed');
            io.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      els.forEach(e=>io.observe(e));
    })();

    // Session Planner logic
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('plannerForm');
      const buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildPlan');
      const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clearPlan');
      const resultEl = document.getElementById('planResult');
      const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
      const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('downloadBtn');

      function safeText(s){return (s||'').trim();}

      function patchTestInstructions(){
        return 'Patch test: apply a small amount (1–2 drops) of the diluted blend to the inner forearm and wait 24 hours. If redness or irritation occurs, discontinue use.';
      }

      function petAndPregnancyNotes(hasPets, notes){
        let out = [];
        if(/pet|dog|cat|animals/i.test(notes)) out.push('Pets at home: ensure good ventilation and avoid oils known to be harmful to animals; we will suggest pet-safer choices.');
        if(/pregnan|preg|nurs/i.test(notes)) out.push('Pregnancy/nursing note: we will avoid contraindicated materials and provide safe alternatives. Always check with your healthcare provider.');
        if(out.length===0) out.push('Environment note: mention pets or pregnancy in your intake so we can tailor suggestions.');
        return out.join(' ');
      }

      function buildSummary(){
        const goal = safeText(document.getElementById('goal').value) || 'General wellbeing support';
        const setting = document.getElementById('setting').value;
        const likes = safeText(document.getElementById('notes').value) || 'no specific notes';
        const intensity = document.getElementById('intensity').value;
        const duration = document.getElementById('duration').value;
        const extras = safeText(document.getElementById('notesArea').value);

        // simple recommendation engine
        let topNotes = 'bergamot, lavender, and a grounding cedarwood';
        if(/citrus|lemon|orange/i.test(likes)) topNotes = 'bergamot, sweet orange, and a mild lavender';
        if(/woody|cedar|sandal/i.test(likes)) topNotes = 'cedarwood, sandalwood, and a mild floral top note';
        if(/floral|rose|ylang/i.test(likes)) topNotes = 'lavender, palmarosa, and a soft ylang ylang (low concentration)';

        const dilution = (duration.includes('VIP') || intensity==='Rich') ? '2–3% for short-term topical blends (adult only)' : '1–2% for topical blends (adult only)';

        const planLines = [];
        planLines.push('Personalized Session Plan');
        planLines.push('-------------------------');
        planLines.push('Intention: ' + goal);
        planLines.push('Setting: ' + setting + ' — Session length: ' + duration + ' — Intensity: ' + intensity);
        planLines.push('Preferred notes / avoid: ' + likes);
        planLines.push('Suggested notes: ' + topNotes + '.');
        planLines.push('Suggested dilution: ' + dilution + '.');
        planLines.push('Patch testing: ' + patchTestInstructions());
        planLines.push('Environment & care: ' + petAndPregnancyNotes(false, extras + ' ' + likes));
        planLines.push('Practical ritual: 2–3 drops onto a personal inhaler or diffuser, 3–5 minutes at transition moments (morning or before sleep) — adjust to preference.');
        planLines.push('Follow-up: We recommend a short check-in 7–14 days after the session to refine ratios and usage notes.');
        planLines.push('Notes: This plan is a suggested starting point and may support comfort or ease; no medical claims are made.');

        return planLines.join('\n');
      }

      buildBtn.addEventListener('click',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const txt = buildSummary();
        resultEl.textContent = txt;
      });

      clearBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        form.reset();
        resultEl.textContent = 'Build a plan using the form to the left.';
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click',async function(){
        try{
          const txt = resultEl.textContent;
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt);
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent='Copy summary',1500);
        }catch(err){
          copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy failed';
          setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent='Copy summary',1500);
        }
      });

      downloadBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        const txt = resultEl.textContent;
        const blob = new Blob([txt],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        a.remove();
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
      });
    })();

    // Contact form handler (simple local feedback)
    function submitContact(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('cname').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('cemail').value.trim();
      const message = document.getElementById('cmessage').value.trim();
      const out = document.getElementById('contactMsg');
      if(!name || !email){ out.textContent = 'Please include your name and email.'; return; }
      out.textContent = 'Thanks — your request has been received. We will reply to ' + email + ' within 2 business days, or call ' + '{{PHONE}}' + ' for faster assistance.';
      // In a production site, this would POST to a server or trigger an email.
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and developer notes for the aromatherapy site (chunk 4).

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html  — Contact page with session-planner widget and scroll-reveal behavior.

Purpose:
- This contact.html implements the session planner interactive widget (builds a plaintext session summary and permits copying or downloading the .txt file).
- Implements scroll-triggered reveal animations while honoring prefers-reduced-motion.
- Uses only local JS/CSS, no external libraries or CDNs.

Key features and implementation notes:
- Scroll reveal: Elements with the attribute data-reveal animate into view via an IntersectionObserver. If the user has prefers-reduced-motion: reduce, the elements are revealed immediately with no transitions.
- Session Planner: A small form builds a suggested plan in plaintext. The build button composes the output, which appears in a monospace-styled result block. Users can copy the text to clipboard or download it as session-plan.txt.
- Safety language: The planner output includes patch-test instructions, dilution guidance, and environment/pregnancy/pet notes. All language avoids medical claims and uses "may support" phrasing.
- Accessibility: live region (aria-live) on the result area is set to polite so screen readers announce changes. Controls are standard form elements.

Placeholders to replace in your environment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}

Styling notes:
- Design uses an earthy/warm palette with CSS variables. Background references assets/img/pattern.svg for the repeating page pattern — make sure that asset exists (unique SVG expected elsewhere in the project).
- No external fonts or images are required.

How to test locally:
1. Place this file alongside the other site files in the project directory.
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari).
3. Test the session planner: enter values, click "Generate plan", then try "Copy summary" and "Download .txt".
4. Toggle your OS preference for reduced motion and refresh to verify the reveal behavior.

Notes for production:
- The contact form currently provides local feedback only; integrate with your backend or form service to accept messages.
- The planner is intentionally simple: if you add server-side features, ensure privacy for submitted notes and secure storage for any health-related disclosures.

Design and voice:
- Voice aims for executive/concise clarity: safety-forward, practical, and professional.
- The page avoids repeating headline tokens flagged as recently used in other templates.

Developer reminders:
- Ensure the unique SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg is present and not reused across other templates to preserve uniqueness constraints.
- If you extend the planner (analytics, persistence), respect user privacy and avoid storing sensitive personal health information unencrypted.

End of notes."}
BUNDLE_END
